# Wiki content: Syncthing rewrites this tree constantly, and git fighting sync
# produces conflict files. The rules file is the one thing worth tracking.
# Must be my_wiki/* not my_wiki/ - git never descends into an excluded directory,
# so the negation below would never be reached.
my_wiki/*
!my_wiki/CLAUDE.md

# Syncthing scratch
.stfolder/
.stversions/
~syncthing~*
